## Someone at the desk, always

Reception is open 24 hours a day, so there is always someone there whatever time you arrive.

Check-in is from 15:00 and check-out is until 11:00. Late check-out is available at EUR 50 until 13:00; past 14:00 a full day is charged. Book direct and you can check in from 14:00.

We have luggage storage, so an early arrival or a late train need not decide your day. Check-in is completed online before you get here.
